flowchart LR
    User[Registered user] -->|Profile, filters, feedback, meal actions| Browser[Django template UI]
    CSV[Cleaned fixed food CSV] --> Import[Validated Django import]
    Import --> FoodDB[(PostgreSQL food catalog)]

    Browser -->|Authenticated request| Web[Django views and DRF API]
    Web --> ProfileDB[(User profile and dietary restrictions)]
    Web --> MealDB[(Meal, water, and weight logs)]
    Web --> FeedbackDB[(Recommendation feedback)]

    FoodDB --> Eligibility[Eligibility and safety filtering]
    ProfileDB --> Eligibility
    ProfileDB --> Budget[Personal calorie and macro targets]
    MealDB --> Budget
    Eligibility --> Candidates[Eligible food candidates]
    Candidates --> Rank[Recommendation scoring]
    Budget --> Rank
    FeedbackDB --> Rank
    Rank --> Results[Sorted recommendations: up to 24]
    Results --> Browser

    Browser -->|Quick-log selected food and grams| QuickLog[Quick-log endpoint]
    QuickLog -->|Scale per-100-g nutrients| MealDB
    MealDB -->|Updated daily totals| Budget

    Browser -->|Nutrition question| Chat[Django chatbot service]
    Chat -->|User-scoped tool requests| ProfileDB
    Chat --> MealDB
    Chat --> FeedbackDB
    Chat --> Rank
    Chat -->|Natural-language response| Browser
